{"metadata":{"kernelspec":{"display_name":"Python 3","language":"python","name":"python3"},"language_info":{"name":"python","version":"3.13.16","mimetype":"text/x-python","codemirror_mode":{"name":"ipython","version":3},"pygments_lexer":"ipython3","nbconvert_exporter":"python","file_extension":".py"},"accelerator":"GPU","kaggle":{"accelerator":"nvidiaTeslaT4","dataSources":[{"sourceType":"datasetVersion","sourceId":20635819}],"isInternetEnabled":false,"language":"python","sourceType":"notebook","isGpuEnabled":false}},"nbformat_minor":5,"nbformat":4,"cells":[{"id":"cell-00","cell_type":"markdown","source":"# 作业二 · 问题二：在 MNIST 上训练无条件 GAN（第二轮优化，Kaggle 版）\n\n本 Notebook 以老师的 `problem2.ipynb` 为底稿，模板要求补全的生成器和判别器已经补全，模板的训练函数、损失和画图函数保持不变。\n\n## 第一轮的结论（A–D 四组，每组 200 轮）\n\n| 设置 | 改动 | 最低 FID（原始 / EMA） |\n|---|---|---|\n| A_template | 模板原样，Adam betas=(0.9, 0.999) | 22.3 / **15.2** |\n| B_beta1_0.5 | beta1 改为 0.5 | 39.6 / 40.3 |\n| C_label_smooth | 再加单侧标签平滑 | 35.3 / 36.7 |\n| D_instance_noise | 再加判别器输入噪声 | 37.3 / 36.3 |\n\n1. 模板原设置 A 最好，第 200 轮时 EMA 的 FID 还在下降，延长训练还有空间。\n2. A 的原始权重 FID 在后期上下跳动，EMA 平均后明显更好，说明后期参数在好的区域附近来回摆动。\n3. beta1=0.5 让结果明显变差，但只测了一个随机种子。\n\n## 第二轮做什么（默认只跑这一轮的 6 组，约 1.5 小时）\n\n| 设置 | 目的 |\n|---|---|\n| A_500 | A 延长到模板默认的 500 轮，看 FID 能否继续下降 |\n| A_500_lrdecay | 与 A_500 相同，只是第 250 轮以后学习率线性降到 0，减小后期参数摆动 |\n| A_seed1、A_seed2 | A 换两个随机种子各跑 200 轮 |\n| B_seed1、B_seed2 | B 换两个随机种子各跑 200 轮，与 A 一起确认 beta1 的结论 |\n\n每组同时保存两份 EMA 权重：系数 0.999（约平均最近 1000 步，约 2 轮）和 0.9999（约平均最近 10000 步，约 21 轮），比较平均窗口长短的影响。最终模型仍从所有组、所有权重中按 FID 最低挑选。\n\n**运行方法**：Kaggle 右侧 Input 挂载 `yuesun0502/cnnmodel-database-minist`，Accelerator 选 GPU，Run All。输出在 `/kaggle/working/hw2_gan/`。如果想在一本 Notebook 里把第一轮也重跑一遍（用于最终提交），把 `RUN_CONFIGS` 改成 `list(CONFIGS)`，总时间约 2.3 小时。","metadata":{}},{"id":"cell-01","cell_type":"markdown","source":"# **0. Load Preliminary Functions**\n# a. Import Libraries and Functions","metadata":{}},{"id":"cell-02","cell_type":"code","source":"import torch\nimport torch.nn as nn\nimport torch.nn.functional as F\n\nfrom torchvision import datasets\nfrom torchvision import transforms\nfrom torch.autograd import Variable\n\nimport matplotlib.pyplot as plt\nfrom tqdm.notebook import tqdm\nimport numpy as np\nfrom mpl_toolkits.mplot3d import Axes3D\n\nimport pickle\nimport itertools\nimport math\n\ndevice = torch.device('cuda' if torch.cuda.is_available() else 'cpu')\n\n# ---- 以下为新增：实验管理、评估与保存 ----\nimport os, json, csv, copy, time, random, struct, shutil, zipfile\nfrom pathlib import Path\nfrom datetime import datetime\nfrom contextlib import contextmanager\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom scipy import linalg\nfrom PIL import Image\n\nSEED = 42\nQUICK_TEST = False          # 只检查代码能否跑通时改成 True\nif os.environ.get('HW2G_QUICK') == '1':\n    QUICK_TEST = True\n\ndef seed_everything(seed):\n    random.seed(seed); np.random.seed(seed); torch.manual_seed(seed)\n    if torch.cuda.is_available():\n        torch.cuda.manual_seed_all(seed)\n\nseed_everything(SEED)\nOUT_ROOT = Path(os.environ.get('HW2G_OUT', '/kaggle/working' if Path('/kaggle/working').is_dir() else '.')) / 'hw2_gan'\nOUT_ROOT.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\nprint('Device:', device, '| 输出目录:', OUT_ROOT)","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-11-11T05:32:44.46647Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-11-11T05:32:44.466705Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-11-11T05:32:54.736406Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-11-11T05:32:44.466684Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-11-11T05:32:54.73529Z"}},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","text":"Device: cuda | 输出目录: /kaggle/working/hw2_gan\n","output_type":"stream"}],"execution_count":1},{"id":"cell-03","cell_type":"markdown","source":"# b. MNIST Data Loader\n\n模板用 `transforms.ToTensor()` + `Normalize(mean=0.5, std=0.5)`，即 $x\\mapsto (x/255-0.5)/0.5\\in[-1,1]$。这里从 Kaggle 的 IDX 文件读取同一份 MNIST，按同样公式换算，并用模板的 `tensor_transform` 对前 100 张图逐一核对。`GPUBatchLoader` 的用法与 `DataLoader` 相同（`len()` 给出每轮批数，迭代得到 `(images, labels)`，每轮重新打乱，最后一批 96 张），只是数据整体放在 GPU 上，速度快很多。","metadata":{}},{"id":"cell-04","cell_type":"code","source":"tensor_transform = transforms.Compose([\n    transforms.ToTensor(),\n    transforms.Normalize(mean=(0.5, ), std=(0.5, ))\n])\n\nbatch_size = 128\n\nDEFAULT_IDX_ROOT = Path(os.environ.get('HW2G_IDX_ROOT', '/kaggle/input/datasets/yuesun0502/cnnmodel-database-minist'))\nIDX_LAYOUT = {\n    'train_images': ('train-images-idx3-ubyte', 'train-images.idx3-ubyte'),\n    'train_labels': ('train-labels-idx1-ubyte', 'train-labels.idx1-ubyte'),\n    'test_images':  ('t10k-images-idx3-ubyte',  't10k-images.idx3-ubyte'),\n    'test_labels':  ('t10k-labels-idx1-ubyte',  't10k-labels.idx1-ubyte'),\n}\n\ndef read_idx(path, kind):\n    with open(path, 'rb') as f:\n        if kind == 'images':\n            magic, n, r, c = struct.unpack('>IIII', f.read(16)); assert magic == 2051\n            return np.frombuffer(f.read(), dtype=np.uint8).reshape(n, r, c).copy()\n        magic, n = struct.unpack('>II', f.read(8)); assert magic == 2049\n        return np.frombuffer(f.read(), dtype=np.uint8).astype(np.int64)\n\ndef load_mnist_uint8():\n    files = {k: DEFAULT_IDX_ROOT / sub / name for k, (sub, name) in IDX_LAYOUT.items()}\n    if not all(p.is_file() for p in files.values()) and Path('/kaggle/input').is_dir():\n        found = {k: sorted(Path('/kaggle/input').rglob(name)) for k, (_, name) in IDX_LAYOUT.items()}\n        if all(found.values()):\n            files = {k: v[0] for k, v in found.items()}\n    if all(p.is_file() for p in files.values()):\n        print('读取 Kaggle IDX 文件：', files['train_images'].parent.parent)\n        return (read_idx(files['train_images'], 'images'), read_idx(files['train_labels'], 'labels'),\n                read_idx(files['test_images'], 'images'), read_idx(files['test_labels'], 'labels'))\n    print('未找到 IDX 文件，改用 torchvision 下载（需要 Internet）')\n    tr = datasets.MNIST(root='./data', train=True, download=True)\n    te = datasets.MNIST(root='./data', train=False, download=True)\n    return tr.data.numpy(), tr.targets.numpy(), te.data.numpy(), te.targets.numpy()\n\ntrain_u8, train_y, test_u8, test_y = load_mnist_uint8()\n\ndef to_minus1_1(u8):\n    return (torch.from_numpy(u8).float().div(255.0).sub(0.5).div(0.5)).unsqueeze(1).to(device)\n\ntrain_images, train_labels = to_minus1_1(train_u8), torch.from_numpy(train_y).to(device)\ntest_images, test_labels = to_minus1_1(test_u8), torch.from_numpy(test_y).to(device)\n\n# 与模板 transforms 的结果逐张核对\nfor i in range(100):\n    ref = tensor_transform(Image.fromarray(train_u8[i]))\n    assert torch.allclose(ref, train_images[i].cpu(), atol=1e-6)\nprint('换算结果与模板 transforms 一致；范围', float(train_images.min()), '~', float(train_images.max()))\n\nclass GPUBatchLoader:\n    def __init__(self, images, labels, batch_size, shuffle=True, seed=SEED):\n        self.images, self.labels = images, labels\n        self.batch_size, self.shuffle = batch_size, shuffle\n        self.gen = torch.Generator().manual_seed(seed)\n    def __len__(self):\n        return math.ceil(len(self.images) / self.batch_size)\n    def __iter__(self):\n        n = len(self.images)\n        order = torch.randperm(n, generator=self.gen) if self.shuffle else torch.arange(n)\n        order = order.to(self.images.device)\n        for s in range(0, n, self.batch_size):\n            idx = order[s:s + self.batch_size]\n            yield self.images[idx], self.labels[idx]\n\ntrain_loader = GPUBatchLoader(train_images, train_labels, batch_size, shuffle=True)\ntest_loader = GPUBatchLoader(test_images, test_labels, batch_size, shuffle=False)\nprint('train:', tuple(train_images.shape), '| test:', tuple(test_images.shape), '| 每轮批数:', len(train_loader))","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-11-11T05:32:54.738472Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-11-11T05:32:54.738893Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-11-11T05:32:56.866575Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-11-11T05:32:54.738856Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-11-11T05:32:56.865928Z"}},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","text":"读取 Kaggle IDX 文件： /kaggle/input/datasets/yuesun0502/cnnmodel-database-minist\n换算结果与模板 transforms 一致；范围 -1.0 ~ 1.0\ntrain: (60000, 1, 28, 28) | test: (10000, 1, 28, 28) | 每轮批数: 469\n","output_type":"stream"}],"execution_count":2},{"id":"cell-05","cell_type":"markdown","source":"# **1. Unconditional GAN**\n\n# a. Training Function for Discriminator（模板原样）","metadata":{}},{"id":"cell-06","cell_type":"code","source":"criterion = nn.BCELoss()\n\ndef train_discriminator(discriminator, d_optimizer, images, real_labels, fake_images, fake_labels, with_condition, cls_labels):\n    discriminator.zero_grad()\n    if with_condition:\n      outputs = discriminator(images, cls_labels)\n    else:\n      outputs = discriminator(images)\n    real_loss = criterion(outputs, real_labels.view(-1, 1))\n    real_score = outputs\n\n    if with_condition:\n      outputs = discriminator(fake_images, cls_labels)\n    else:\n      outputs = discriminator(fake_images)\n\n    fake_loss = criterion(outputs, fake_labels.view(-1, 1))\n    fake_score = outputs\n\n    d_loss = real_loss + fake_loss\n    d_loss.backward()\n    d_optimizer.step()\n    return d_loss, real_score, fake_score, fake_loss","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-11-11T05:32:56.867603Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-11-11T05:32:56.867901Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-11-11T05:32:56.874011Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-11-11T05:32:56.867869Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-11-11T05:32:56.873299Z"}},"outputs":[],"execution_count":3},{"id":"cell-07","cell_type":"markdown","source":"# b. Training Function for Generator（模板原样）\n\n`g_loss` 是 $-\\log D(G(z))$，用于更新生成器；`g_loss_fake` 是 $-\\log(1-D(G(z)))$，只做记录。","metadata":{}},{"id":"cell-08","cell_type":"code","source":"def train_generator(generator, g_optimizer, discriminator_outputs, real_labels, with_condition):\n    generator.zero_grad()\n    g_loss = criterion(discriminator_outputs, real_labels.view(-1, 1))\n    g_loss_fake = criterion(discriminator_outputs, 1 - real_labels.view(-1, 1))\n    g_loss.backward()\n    g_optimizer.step()\n    return g_loss, g_loss_fake","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-11-11T05:32:56.875116Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-11-11T05:32:56.875459Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-11-11T05:32:56.893844Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-11-11T05:32:56.875439Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-11-11T05:32:56.892972Z"}},"outputs":[],"execution_count":4},{"id":"cell-09","cell_type":"markdown","source":"# c. Monitors for Images and Losses（模板原样）\n\n`save_template_figure` 是新增的小工具：调用模板函数时顺便把显示的图保存下来，模板函数本身不改。","metadata":{}},{"id":"cell-10","cell_type":"code","source":"def monitor_images(generator, test_noise, with_condition):\n    num_test_samples = test_noise.shape[0]\n    size_figure_grid = int(math.sqrt(num_test_samples))\n    fig, ax = plt.subplots(size_figure_grid, size_figure_grid, figsize=(6, 6))\n    for i, j in itertools.product(range(size_figure_grid), range(size_figure_grid)):\n        ax[i,j].get_xaxis().set_visible(False)\n        ax[i,j].get_yaxis().set_visible(False)\n\n    if with_condition:\n      cls_labels = torch.randint(0, 10, (num_test_samples,)).to(device)\n      test_images = generator(test_noise, label = cls_labels)\n    else:\n      test_images = generator(test_noise)\n\n    for k in range(num_test_samples):\n        i = k//4\n        j = k%4\n        ax[i,j].cla()\n        ax[i,j].imshow(test_images[k,:].data.cpu().numpy().reshape(28, 28), cmap='Greys')\n        if with_condition:\n            ax[i, j].set_title(f'Class: {cls_labels[k].item()}', fontsize=10)\n    plt.show()\n\n\ndef monitor_losses(d_losses, d_losses_fake, g_losses, g_losses_fake):\n    def moving_average(x, win=100):\n        return np.convolve(x, np.ones(win), 'same') / np.convolve(np.ones_like(x), np.ones(win), 'same')\n\n    plt.figure(figsize=(10, 5))\n    iters = np.arange(len(d_losses))\n    epochs = iters * batch_size / 60000\n    plt.plot(epochs, moving_average(d_losses), label='d_loss')\n    plt.plot(epochs, moving_average(g_losses), label='g_loss')\n    plt.plot(epochs, moving_average(d_losses_fake), label='d_loss_fake')\n    plt.plot(epochs, moving_average(g_losses_fake), label='g_loss_fake')\n    plt.xlabel('epochs')\n    plt.ylabel('loss')\n    plt.legend()\n    plt.show()\n\n\n@contextmanager\ndef save_template_figure(path):\n    original_show = plt.show\n    def show_and_save(*args, **kwargs):\n        plt.gcf().savefig(path, bbox_inches='tight', facecolor='white', dpi=150)\n        original_show(*args, **kwargs)\n    plt.show = show_and_save\n    try:\n        yield\n    finally:\n        plt.show = original_show","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-11-11T05:32:56.895827Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-11-11T05:32:56.896032Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-11-11T05:32:56.910785Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-11-11T05:32:56.896014Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-11-11T05:32:56.909883Z"}},"outputs":[],"execution_count":5},{"id":"cell-11","cell_type":"markdown","source":"# c. Model for Discriminator（Problem 1：已补全）\n\n784 → 512 → 256 → 128 → 1。每个隐藏层：Linear → LeakyReLU(0.2) → Dropout(0.3)。输出层 Sigmoid，给出“是真实图片”的概率，配合模板的 `BCELoss`。不用批归一化。`use_sigmoid=False` 只在可选的 WGAN-GP 对照里使用。","metadata":{}},{"id":"cell-12","cell_type":"code","source":"class Discriminator(nn.Module):\n    def __init__(self, channels = [512, 256, 128], with_condition=False,\n                 negative_slope=0.2, dropout=0.3, use_sigmoid=True):\n        super().__init__()\n        self.with_condition = with_condition\n        self.model = None\n\n        ##################\n        ### Problem 1: Implement Discriminator\n        layers, in_dim = [], 784\n        for ch in channels:\n            layers += [nn.Linear(in_dim, ch), nn.LeakyReLU(negative_slope), nn.Dropout(dropout)]\n            in_dim = ch\n        layers.append(nn.Linear(in_dim, 1))\n        if use_sigmoid:\n            layers.append(nn.Sigmoid())\n        self.model = nn.Sequential(*layers)\n        ##################\n\n    def forward(self, x, label=None):\n        x = x.view(x.size(0), 784)\n        if self.with_condition:\n          assert label is not None\n          ##################\n          ### Problem 3: Implement Conditional GAN (desperated)\n          raise NotImplementedError('本次作业只要求无条件 GAN')\n          ##################\n        out = self.model(x)\n        out = out.view(out.size(0), -1)\n        return out","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-11-11T05:32:56.911787Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-11-11T05:32:56.912141Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-11-11T05:32:56.928268Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-11-11T05:32:56.912084Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-11-11T05:32:56.927452Z"}},"outputs":[],"execution_count":6},{"id":"cell-13","cell_type":"markdown","source":"# e. Model for Generator（Problem 1：已补全）\n\n100 → 128 → 256 → 512 → 784。隐藏层 Linear → LeakyReLU(0.2)，输出层 Tanh，范围 `[-1,1]`，与数据一致。不用批归一化，不用 dropout。","metadata":{}},{"id":"cell-14","cell_type":"code","source":"class Generator(nn.Module):\n    def __init__(self, dim_z=100, channels = [128, 256, 512], with_condition=False, negative_slope=0.2):\n        super().__init__()\n        self.dim_z = dim_z\n        self.with_condition = with_condition\n\n        self.model = None\n        ##################\n        ### Problem 1: Implement Generator\n        layers, in_dim = [], dim_z\n        for ch in channels:\n            layers += [nn.Linear(in_dim, ch), nn.LeakyReLU(negative_slope)]\n            in_dim = ch\n        layers += [nn.Linear(in_dim, 784), nn.Tanh()]\n        self.model = nn.Sequential(*layers)\n        ##################\n\n    def forward(self, x, label=None):\n        x = x.view(x.size(0), self.dim_z)\n\n        if self.with_condition:\n          assert label is not None\n          ##################\n          ### Problem 3: Implement Conditional GAN (desperated)\n          raise NotImplementedError('本次作业只要求无条件 GAN')\n          ##################\n\n        out = self.model(x)\n        return out\n\n# 结构检查：只看形状和取值范围，不需要梯度，所以放在 no_grad 里\n_G, _D = Generator().to(device), Discriminator().to(device)\nwith torch.no_grad():\n    _x = _G(torch.randn(4, 100, device=device))\n    _o = _D(_x.view(4, 1, 28, 28))\nassert _x.shape == (4, 784) and float(_x.abs().max()) <= 1\nassert _o.shape == (4, 1) and float(_o.min()) >= 0 and float(_o.max()) <= 1\nprint(_G); print(_D)\nprint(f'Generator 参数 {sum(p.numel() for p in _G.parameters()):,} | Discriminator 参数 {sum(p.numel() for p in _D.parameters()):,}')\ndel _G, _D, _x, _o","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-11-11T05:32:56.929065Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-11-11T05:32:56.929359Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-11-11T05:32:57.173659Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-11-11T05:32:56.929338Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-11-11T05:32:57.172898Z"}},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","text":"Generator(\n  (model): Sequential(\n    (0): Linear(in_features=100, out_features=128, bias=True)\n    (1): LeakyReLU(negative_slope=0.2)\n    (2): Linear(in_features=128, out_features=256, bias=True)\n    (3): LeakyReLU(negative_slope=0.2)\n    (4): Linear(in_features=256, out_features=512, bias=True)\n    (5): LeakyReLU(negative_slope=0.2)\n    (6): Linear(in_features=512, out_features=784, bias=True)\n    (7): Tanh()\n  )\n)\nDiscriminator(\n  (model): Sequential(\n    (0): Linear(in_features=784, out_features=512, bias=True)\n    (1): LeakyReLU(negative_slope=0.2)\n    (2): Dropout(p=0.3, inplace=False)\n    (3): Linear(in_features=512, out_features=256, bias=True)\n    (4): LeakyReLU(negative_slope=0.2)\n    (5): Dropout(p=0.3, inplace=False)\n    (6): Linear(in_features=256, out_features=128, bias=True)\n    (7): LeakyReLU(negative_slope=0.2)\n    (8): Dropout(p=0.3, inplace=False)\n    (9): Linear(in_features=128, out_features=1, bias=True)\n    (10): Sigmoid()\n  )\n)\nGenerator 参数 579,728 | Discriminator 参数 566,273\n","output_type":"stream"}],"execution_count":7},{"id":"cell-15","cell_type":"markdown","source":"# d. Training（模板主循环，保留原样供对照）\n\n下面是模板的 `train_main_loop`，一字未改。它每轮都调用两次画图函数，500 轮会产生 1000 张图，而且只能跑一组设置。所以实际实验用下一节的 `train_gan_run`。两者每次迭代的步骤一一对应：采样噪声 → 生成假图 → `train_discriminator` → 重新采样噪声 → `train_generator`。","metadata":{}},{"id":"cell-16","cell_type":"code","source":"num_batches = len(train_loader)\n\ndef train_main_loop(generator, discriminator, d_optimizer, g_optimizer, test_noise,\n                    num_epochs, d_freq, with_condition):\n  d_losses = []\n  g_losses = []\n  d_losses_fake = []\n  g_losses_fake = []\n  for epoch in range(num_epochs):\n      for n, (images, cls_labels) in enumerate(train_loader):\n          images = Variable(images.to(device))\n          real_labels = Variable(torch.ones(images.size(0)).to(device))\n          cls_labels = cls_labels.to(device)\n\n          # Sample from generator\n          noise = Variable(torch.randn(images.size(0), dim_z).to(device))\n          fake_images = generator(noise, label=cls_labels if with_condition else None)\n          fake_labels = Variable(torch.zeros(images.size(0)).to(device))\n\n          # Train the discriminator\n          d_loss, real_score, fake_score, d_loss_fake = train_discriminator(discriminator, d_optimizer, images, real_labels, fake_images, fake_labels, with_condition, cls_labels=cls_labels)\n\n          if n % d_freq == 0:\n            # Sample again from the generator and get output from discriminator\n            noise = Variable(torch.randn(images.size(0), dim_z).to(device))\n            fake_images = generator(noise, label=cls_labels if with_condition else None)\n            outputs = discriminator(fake_images, label=cls_labels if with_condition else None)\n\n            # Train the generator\n            g_loss, g_loss_fake = train_generator(generator, g_optimizer, outputs, real_labels, with_condition)\n\n          d_losses.append(d_loss.data.detach().cpu().numpy())\n          g_losses.append(g_loss.data.detach().cpu().numpy())\n          d_losses_fake.append(d_loss_fake.data.detach().cpu().numpy())\n          g_losses_fake.append(g_loss_fake.data.detach().cpu().numpy())\n\n          if (n+1) % 100 == 0:\n              print('Epoch [%d/%d], Step[%d/%d], d_loss: %.4f, d_loss_fake: %.4f, g_loss: %.4f, g_loss_fake: %.4f, '\n                    'D(x): %.2f, D(G(z)): %.2f'\n                    %(epoch + 1, num_epochs, n+1, num_batches, d_loss.data, d_loss_fake.data, g_loss.data, g_loss_fake.data,\n                      real_score.data.mean(), fake_score.data.mean()))\n\n      monitor_images(generator, test_noise, with_condition=with_condition)\n      monitor_losses(d_losses, d_losses_fake, g_losses, g_losses_fake)\n  return d_losses, d_losses_fake, g_losses, g_losses_fake","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-11-11T05:32:57.17463Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-11-11T05:32:57.17492Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-11-11T05:32:57.184066Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-11-11T05:32:57.1749Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-11-11T05:32:57.183343Z"}},"outputs":[],"execution_count":8},{"id":"cell-17","cell_type":"markdown","source":"## 实验设置\n\n模板默认 `num_epochs = 500`、`lr = 0.0002`、`dim_z = 100`、`d_freq = 1`、batch 128，这些值都保留。每组的轮数、随机种子和学习率衰减写在 `CONFIGS` 里。`make_cfg` 只是把“基础设置 A/B/C/D”和这三项拼成一组完整设置，避免重复书写。","metadata":{}},{"id":"cell-18","cell_type":"code","source":"# set number of epochs and initialize figure counter\nnum_epochs = 500            # 模板默认值；每组实际轮数见 CONFIGS\ndim_z = 100\nnum_test_samples = 16\nd_freq = 1\nwith_condition = False\nlr = 0.0002\n\nBASE = {   # 第一轮的四种基础设置\n    'A': dict(betas=(0.9, 0.999), real_label=1.0, noise_std=0.0),\n    'B': dict(betas=(0.5, 0.999), real_label=1.0, noise_std=0.0),\n    'C': dict(betas=(0.5, 0.999), real_label=0.9, noise_std=0.0),\n    'D': dict(betas=(0.5, 0.999), real_label=0.9, noise_std=0.1),\n}\ndef make_cfg(base, epochs=200, seed=SEED, lr_decay_start=None):\n    return dict(BASE[base], group=base, epochs=epochs, seed=seed, lr_decay_start=lr_decay_start)\n\nCONFIGS = {\n    # 第一轮\n    'A_template': make_cfg('A'), 'B_beta1_0.5': make_cfg('B'),\n    'C_label_smooth': make_cfg('C'), 'D_instance_noise': make_cfg('D'),\n    # 第二轮\n    'A_500': make_cfg('A', epochs=500),\n    'A_500_lrdecay': make_cfg('A', epochs=500, lr_decay_start=250),\n    'A_seed1': make_cfg('A', seed=1), 'A_seed2': make_cfg('A', seed=2),\n    'B_seed1': make_cfg('B', seed=1), 'B_seed2': make_cfg('B', seed=2),\n}\nROUND2 = ['A_500', 'A_500_lrdecay', 'A_seed1', 'A_seed2', 'B_seed1', 'B_seed2']\nRUN_CONFIGS = ROUND2        # 全部重跑：list(CONFIGS)\nRUN_WGAN_GP = False         # 补充对照：WGAN-GP（改变了模板损失）\nNOISE_DECAY_FRAC = 0.5      # 实例噪声在前 50% 的轮次内线性减到 0\nEMA_DECAYS = (0.999, 0.9999)\nEVAL_EVERY = 5\nEVAL_SAMPLES = 5000\nMONITOR_EVERY = 0           # >0 时训练中每隔多少轮调用一次模板的两个画图函数\nSNAPSHOT_EPOCHS = [1, 5, 10, 25, 50, 100, 150, 200, 250, 300, 400, 500]\nCLASSIFIER_EPOCHS = 3\n# 第一轮种子 42 的结果（上一次运行），供随机种子对照时参考\nROUND1_SEED42 = {'A': {'best_fid_raw': 22.34, 'best_fid_ema0.999': 15.25},\n                 'B': {'best_fid_raw': 39.62, 'best_fid_ema0.999': 40.29}}\n\noverride = int(os.environ['HW2G_EPOCHS']) if os.environ.get('HW2G_EPOCHS') else (2 if QUICK_TEST else None)\nif override:\n    for c in CONFIGS.values():\n        c['epochs'] = override\n        if c['lr_decay_start']:\n            c['lr_decay_start'] = max(1, override // 2)\nif QUICK_TEST:\n    EVAL_EVERY, CLASSIFIER_EPOCHS = 1, 1\nEVAL_EVERY = int(os.environ.get('HW2G_EVAL_EVERY', EVAL_EVERY))\nCLASSIFIER_EPOCHS = int(os.environ.get('HW2G_CLF_EPOCHS', CLASSIFIER_EPOCHS))\nif os.environ.get('HW2G_CONFIGS'):\n    RUN_CONFIGS = os.environ['HW2G_CONFIGS'].split(',')\nif os.environ.get('HW2G_WGAN') == '1':\n    RUN_WGAN_GP = True\n\nseed_everything(SEED)\ntest_noise = torch.randn(num_test_samples, dim_z, generator=torch.Generator().manual_seed(SEED)).to(device)\nprint('运行的设置:', RUN_CONFIGS, '| WGAN-GP:', RUN_WGAN_GP)\nfor n in RUN_CONFIGS:\n    print(f'  {n}: {CONFIGS[n]}')","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-11-11T05:32:57.185198Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-11-11T05:32:57.185473Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-11-11T05:32:57.20922Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-11-11T05:32:57.185441Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-11-11T05:32:57.208465Z"}},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","text":"运行的设置: ['A_500', 'A_500_lrdecay', 'A_seed1', 'A_seed2', 'B_seed1', 'B_seed2'] | WGAN-GP: False\n  A_500: {'betas': (0.9, 0.999), 'real_label': 1.0, 'noise_std': 0.0, 'group': 'A', 'epochs': 500, 'seed': 42, 'lr_decay_start': None}\n  A_500_lrdecay: {'betas': (0.9, 0.999), 'real_label': 1.0, 'noise_std': 0.0, 'group': 'A', 'epochs': 500, 'seed': 42, 'lr_decay_start': 250}\n  A_seed1: {'betas': (0.9, 0.999), 'real_label': 1.0, 'noise_std': 0.0, 'group': 'A', 'epochs': 200, 'seed': 1, 'lr_decay_start': None}\n  A_seed2: {'betas': (0.9, 0.999), 'real_label': 1.0, 'noise_std': 0.0, 'group': 'A', 'epochs': 200, 'seed': 2, 'lr_decay_start': None}\n  B_seed1: {'betas': (0.5, 0.999), 'real_label': 1.0, 'noise_std': 0.0, 'group': 'B', 'epochs': 200, 'seed': 1, 'lr_decay_start': None}\n  B_seed2: {'betas': (0.5, 0.999), 'real_label': 1.0, 'noise_std': 0.0, 'group': 'B', 'epochs': 200, 'seed': 2, 'lr_decay_start': None}\n","output_type":"stream"}],"execution_count":9},{"id":"cell-19","cell_type":"markdown","source":"## 评估工具：MNIST 分类器、FID、类别分布（只用于评估）\n\n先训练一个小卷积网络分类 MNIST（输入同样是 `[-1,1]`）。它在 GAN 训练中不起作用，只用来：\n\n- **FID**：取分类器倒数第二层的 128 维特征，比较生成图与 10000 张真实训练图的特征均值和协方差，$\\mathrm{FID}=\\|\\mu_r-\\mu_g\\|^2+\\mathrm{Tr}\\big(\\Sigma_r+\\Sigma_g-2(\\Sigma_r\\Sigma_g)^{1/2}\\big)$。越小越接近真实分布，同时反映清晰度和多样性。真实测试集对真实训练集的 FID 作为下限参考。\n- **类别分布**：生成图被分到 0～9 各类的比例，真实数据约各占 10%。\n- **分类器得分**：$\\exp\\big(\\mathbb E_x\\mathrm{KL}(p(y|x)\\|p(y))\\big)$，最大为 10。","metadata":{}},{"id":"cell-20","cell_type":"code","source":"class MNISTEvalNet(nn.Module):\n    def __init__(self):\n        super().__init__()\n        self.features = nn.Sequential(\n            nn.Conv2d(1, 32, 3, padding=1), nn.ReLU(), nn.MaxPool2d(2),\n            nn.Conv2d(32, 64, 3, padding=1), nn.ReLU(), nn.MaxPool2d(2),\n            nn.Flatten(), nn.Linear(64 * 7 * 7, 128), nn.ReLU())\n        self.head = nn.Sequential(nn.Dropout(0.3), nn.Linear(128, 10))\n    def forward(self, x):\n        return self.head(self.features(x.view(-1, 1, 28, 28)))\n\nseed_everything(SEED)\neval_net = MNISTEvalNet().to(device)\nopt_eval = torch.optim.Adam(eval_net.parameters(), lr=1e-3)\nclf_loader = GPUBatchLoader(train_images, train_labels, 256, shuffle=True, seed=SEED + 1)\nfor ep in range(CLASSIFIER_EPOCHS):\n    eval_net.train()\n    for xb, yb in clf_loader:\n        loss = F.cross_entropy(eval_net(xb), yb)\n        opt_eval.zero_grad(set_to_none=True); loss.backward(); opt_eval.step()\neval_net.eval()\n\n@torch.no_grad()\ndef feats_and_probs(x, bs=2500):\n    feats, probs = [], []\n    for s in range(0, len(x), bs):\n        f = eval_net.features(x[s:s + bs].view(-1, 1, 28, 28))\n        feats.append(f.double().cpu()); probs.append(F.softmax(eval_net.head(f), dim=1))\n    return torch.cat(feats).numpy(), torch.cat(probs)\n\ndef fid_from_feats(f1, f2):\n    # Tr((S1 S2)^(1/2)) = Tr((S1^(1/2) S2 S1^(1/2))^(1/2))，后者是对称矩阵，用特征值计算更稳定\n    mu1, mu2 = f1.mean(0), f2.mean(0)\n    s1, s2 = np.cov(f1, rowvar=False), np.cov(f2, rowvar=False)\n    w1, v1 = linalg.eigh(s1)\n    s1_half = (v1 * np.sqrt(np.clip(w1, 0, None))) @ v1.T\n    w = linalg.eigvalsh(s1_half @ s2 @ s1_half)\n    tr_covmean = np.sqrt(np.clip(w, 0, None)).sum()\n    return float(((mu1 - mu2) ** 2).sum() + np.trace(s1) + np.trace(s2) - 2 * tr_covmean)\n\ndef stats_from(feats, probs):\n    p_y = probs.mean(0, keepdim=True)\n    kl = (probs * (torch.log(probs + 1e-12) - torch.log(p_y + 1e-12))).sum(1).mean()\n    share = (torch.bincount(probs.argmax(1), minlength=10).float() / len(probs)).cpu().numpy()\n    return {'fid': fid_from_feats(REF_FEATS, feats), 'score': float(torch.exp(kl)),\n            'class_share': share.tolist(), 'min_share': float(share.min()), 'max_share': float(share.max()),\n            'confidence': float(probs.max(1).values.mean())}\n\n@torch.no_grad()\ndef evaluate_generator(G, n=EVAL_SAMPLES, seed=SEED + 99):\n    G.eval()\n    z = torch.randn(n, dim_z, generator=torch.Generator().manual_seed(seed)).to(device)\n    imgs = torch.cat([G(z[s:s + 5000]) for s in range(0, n, 5000)])\n    return stats_from(*feats_and_probs(imgs))\n\nwith torch.no_grad():\n    acc = float(torch.cat([eval_net(test_images[s:s + 5000]).argmax(1) for s in range(0, 10000, 5000)]).eq(test_labels).float().mean())\nref_idx = torch.randperm(60000, generator=torch.Generator().manual_seed(SEED + 5))[:10000].to(device)\nREF_FEATS, _ = feats_and_probs(train_images[ref_idx])\nREAL_TEST_STATS = stats_from(*feats_and_probs(test_images))\nprint(f'评估分类器测试准确率 {acc:.4f}')\nprint(f'真实测试集：FID {REAL_TEST_STATS[\"fid\"]:.3f}（下限参考），分类器得分 {REAL_TEST_STATS[\"score\"]:.3f}，'\n      f'最小类别比例 {REAL_TEST_STATS[\"min_share\"]:.3f}')","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-11-11T05:32:57.210397Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-11-11T05:32:57.21093Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-11-11T05:33:05.70217Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-11-11T05:32:57.210899Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-11-11T05:33:05.701486Z"}},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","text":"评估分类器测试准确率 0.9867\n真实测试集：FID 1.743（下限参考），分类器得分 9.586，最小类别比例 0.089\n","output_type":"stream"}],"execution_count":10},{"id":"cell-21","cell_type":"markdown","source":"## 实验训练循环 `train_gan_run`\n\n与模板主循环逐步对应：采样噪声 → 生成假图 → `train_discriminator` → 重新采样噪声 → `train_generator`。在此基础上加了以下几项：\n\n1. **判别器步对假图 detach。** 模板没有 detach，判别器的梯度会顺带算到生成器上，但 `train_generator` 一开始就把生成器梯度清零，所以参数更新完全相同，只是省掉一次无用的反向传播。\n2. **每组用自己的随机种子。** 网络初始化、每轮的打乱顺序和噪声都由 `cfg['seed']` 决定，换种子就是换一次完整的随机过程。\n3. **学习率衰减（可选）。** 每轮开始时由 `lr_factor` 算出这一轮的倍数：衰减开始前为 1，之后线性下降，最后一轮为 1/(总轮数−开始轮数+1)。两个优化器同时调整。\n4. **多份 EMA 权重。** 每次更新生成器后，对 `EMA_DECAYS` 中的每个系数各更新一份平均权重：新平均 = 系数 × 旧平均 + (1−系数) × 当前权重。系数越接近 1，平均的时间窗口越长。\n5. **评估与挑选。** 每 `EVAL_EVERY` 轮对原始权重和每份 EMA 权重各算一次 FID 和类别分布，分别保存 FID 最低的那一份。\n6. 可选的标签平滑和实例噪声，与第一轮相同。","metadata":{}},{"id":"cell-22","cell_type":"code","source":"def add_instance_noise(x, std):\n    return x if std <= 0 else x + std * torch.randn_like(x)\n\n@torch.no_grad()\ndef update_ema(ema_model, model, decay):\n    for pe, p in zip(ema_model.parameters(), model.parameters()):\n        pe.mul_(decay).add_(p.detach(), alpha=1 - decay)\n\ndef cpu_state(model):\n    return {k: v.detach().cpu().clone() for k, v in model.state_dict().items()}\n\ndef lr_factor(epoch, cfg):\n    start, total = cfg.get('lr_decay_start'), cfg['epochs']\n    if not start or epoch <= start:\n        return 1.0\n    return (total - epoch + 1) / (total - start + 1)\n\ndef run_snapshot_epochs(epochs):\n    return {e for e in SNAPSHOT_EPOCHS if e <= epochs} | {1, epochs}\n\ndef evaluate_all(models, epoch, best, eval_log):\n    ev = {'epoch': epoch}\n    for tag, model in models.items():\n        st = evaluate_generator(model)\n        ev.update({f'{tag}_{k}': v for k, v in st.items() if k != 'class_share'})\n        ev[f'{tag}_class_share'] = st['class_share']\n        if st['fid'] < best[tag]['fid']:\n            best[tag] = {'fid': st['fid'], 'epoch': epoch, 'state': cpu_state(model), 'stats': st}\n    eval_log.append(ev)\n    return ev\n\ndef train_gan_run(name, cfg):\n    epochs, seed = cfg['epochs'], cfg['seed']\n    seed_everything(seed)\n    discriminator = Discriminator(with_condition=with_condition).to(device)\n    generator = Generator(dim_z=dim_z, with_condition=with_condition).to(device)\n    d_optimizer = torch.optim.Adam(discriminator.parameters(), lr=lr, betas=cfg['betas'])\n    g_optimizer = torch.optim.Adam(generator.parameters(), lr=lr, betas=cfg['betas'])\n    emas = {f'ema{d}': copy.deepcopy(generator) for d in EMA_DECAYS}\n    for m in emas.values():\n        for p in m.parameters():\n            p.requires_grad_(False)\n    models =