D：raw 22.02（第 175 轮） | ema0.999 14.99（第 200 轮） | ema0.9999 15.20（第 200 轮）\n\n[B_seed1] epoch   1/200 | lr 2.0e-04 | d_loss 0.688 g_loss 1.819 | D(x) 0.838 D(G(z)) 0.340 | FID@1 raw 1148.72 ema0.999 1304.79 ema0.9999 1303.58 | 最小类别比例 0.000 | 4s\n[B_seed1] epoch  25/200 | lr 2.0e-04 | d_loss 0.914 g_loss 1.463 | D(x) 0.700 D(G(z)) 0.302 | FID@25 raw 204.77 ema0.999 189.12 ema0.9999 704.25 | 最小类别比例 0.015 | 85s\n[B_seed1] epoch  50/200 | lr 2.0e-04 | d_loss 1.043 g_loss 1.233 | D(x) 0.649 D(G(z)) 0.351 | FID@50 raw 98.31 ema0.999 87.12 ema0.9999 224.96 | 最小类别比例 0.047 | 170s\n[B_seed1] epoch  75/200 | lr 2.0e-04 | d_loss 1.098 g_loss 1.152 | D(x) 0.627 D(G(z)) 0.371 | FID@75 raw 57.28 ema0.999 56.18 ema0.9999 103.73 | 最小类别比例 0.053 | 255s\n","output_type":"stream"}],"execution_count":null},{"id":"cell-24","cell_type":"markdown","source":"## 可选：WGAN-GP 补充对照（`RUN_WGAN_GP = True` 时运行）\n\nLecture 10 的思路：判别器改成打分器 $f_w$（同样的结构，去掉 Sigmoid），打分器最大化 $\\mathbb E[f_w(x)]-\\mathbb E[f_w(G(z))]$，生成器最小化 $-\\mathbb E[f_w(G(z))]$；1-Lipschitz 约束用梯度惩罚实现（系数 10）。按 WGAN-GP 论文的常用设置：每更新 5 次打分器更新 1 次生成器，Adam 学习率 1e-4，betas=(0.5, 0.9)。它不使用模板的 `BCELoss`，所以只作为补充，不作为题目要求的主结果。","metadata":{}},{"id":"cell-25","cell_type":"code","source":"def train_wgan_gp_run(name='E_wgan_gp', epochs=200, n_critic=5, gp_weight=10.0, lr_w=1e-4, betas=(0.5, 0.9)):\n    seed_everything(SEED)\n    critic = Discriminator(with_condition=False, use_sigmoid=False).to(device)\n    generator = Generator(dim_z=dim_z).to(device)\n    c_opt = torch.optim.Adam(critic.parameters(), lr=lr_w, betas=betas)\n    g_opt = torch.optim.Adam(generator.parameters(), lr=lr_w, betas=betas)\n    emas = {f'ema{d}': copy.deepcopy(generator) for d in EMA_DECAYS}\n    for m in emas.values():\n        for p in m.parameters():\n            p.requires_grad_(False)\n    models = {'raw': generator, **emas}\n    loader = GPUBatchLoader(train_images, train_labels, batch_size, shuffle=True, seed=SEED)\n    keys = ['critic_loss', 'g_loss', 'w_estimate', 'gp']\n    iter_chunks, epoch_log, eval_log, snapshots = [], [], [], {}\n    best = {t: {'fid': float('inf')} for t in models}\n    snap_set = run_snapshot_epochs(epochs)\n    last_g = torch.zeros((), device=device)\n    t0, step = time.time(), 0\n    for epoch in range(1, epochs + 1):\n        generator.train()\n        buf = torch.zeros(len(loader), len(keys), device=device)\n        for n, (images, _) in enumerate(loader):\n            b = images.size(0)\n            fake = generator(torch.randn(b, dim_z, device=device)).detach().view(b, 1, 28, 28)\n            f_real, f_fake = critic(images).mean(), critic(fake).mean()\n            alpha = torch.rand(b, 1, 1, 1, device=device)\n            x_hat = (alpha * images + (1 - alpha) * fake).requires_grad_(True)\n            grad = torch.autograd.grad(critic(x_hat).sum(), x_hat, create_graph=True)[0].view(b, -1)\n            gp = ((grad.norm(2, dim=1) - 1) ** 2).mean()\n            c_loss = f_fake - f_real + gp_weight * gp\n            c_opt.zero_grad(set_to_none=True); c_loss.backward(); c_opt.step()\n            step += 1\n            if step % n_critic == 0:\n                g_loss = -critic(generator(torch.randn(b, dim_z, device=device))).mean()\n                g_opt.zero_grad(set_to_none=True); g_loss.backward(); g_opt.step()\n                for d, m in zip(EMA_DECAYS, emas.values()):\n                    update_ema(m, generator, d)\n                last_g = g_loss.detach()\n            buf[n] = torch.stack([c_loss.detach(), last_g, (f_real - f_fake).detach(), gp.detach()])\n        arr = buf.cpu().numpy()\n        iter_chunks.append(arr)\n        epoch_log.append({'epoch': epoch, **{k: float(arr[:, i].mean()) for i, k in enumerate(keys)}})\n        if epoch in snap_set:\n            with torch.no_grad():\n                snapshots[epoch] = generator.eval()(test_noise).cpu().numpy()\n        if epoch == 1 or epoch % EVAL_EVERY == 0 or epoch == epochs:\n            evaluate_all(models, epoch, best, eval_log)\n        if epoch == 1 or epoch % 25 == 0 or epoch == epochs:\n            ev = eval_log[-1]\n            print(f'[{name}] epoch {epoch:3d}/{epochs} | W 估计 {epoch_log[-1][\"w_estimate\"]:.3f} | '\n                  + ' '.join(f'{t} {ev[f\"{t}_fid\"]:.2f}' for t in models) + f' | {time.time() - t0:.0f}s')\n    logs = np.concatenate(iter_chunks)\n    return {'name': name, 'cfg': {'n_critic': n_critic, 'gp_weight': gp_weight, 'lr': lr_w, 'betas': betas,\n                                  'epochs': epochs, 'seed': SEED, 'group': 'WGAN-GP', 'lr_decay_start': None},\n            'kind': 'wgan_gp', 'tags': list(models), 'logs': {k: logs[:, i] for i, k in enumerate(keys)},\n            'epoch_log': epoch_log, 'eval_log': eval_log, 'snapshots': snapshots, 'best': best,\n            'final_states': {t: cpu_state(m) for t, m in models.items()}, 'seconds': time.time() - t0}\n\nif RUN_WGAN_GP:\n    runs['E_wgan_gp'] = train_wgan_gp_run(epochs=override or 200)\nelse:\n    print('RUN_WGAN_GP = False，跳过 WGAN-GP 补充对照。')","metadata":{"trusted":true},"outputs":[],"execution_count":null},{"id":"cell-26","cell_type":"markdown","source":"## 各组设置的对比与最终模型的选择\n\n表中 FID 越低越好。“最低 FID” 是训练中每 `EVAL_EVERY` 轮评估一次得到的最小值；“末轮 FID” 是训练结束时的值，两者差得多说明后期质量有回落。最终模型取所有组、原始权重与 EMA 权重中 FID 最低的一个。","metadata":{}},{"id":"cell-27","cell_type":"code","source":"table = []\nfor name, r in runs.items():\n    last_ev, last_ep = r['eval_log'][-1], r['epoch_log'][-1]\n    row = {'setting': name, 'group': r['cfg']['group'], 'seed': r['cfg']['seed'], 'epochs': r['cfg']['epochs'],\n           'lr_decay_start': r['cfg'].get('lr_decay_start')}\n    for t in r['tags']:\n        row[f'best_fid_{t}'] = r['best'][t]['fid']\n        row[f'best_epoch_{t}'] = r['best'][t]['epoch']\n        row[f'final_fid_{t}'] = last_ev[f'{t}_fid']\n    row.update({'final_score_raw': last_ev['raw_score'], 'final_min_share_raw': last_ev['raw_min_share'],\n                'final_D(x)': last_ep.get('real_score', float('nan')),\n                'final_D(G(z))': last_ep.get('fake_score', float('nan')), 'minutes': r['seconds'] / 60})\n    table.append(row)\npd.DataFrame(table).to_csv(OUT_ROOT / 'gan_settings_comparison.csv', index=False, encoding='utf-8-sig')\n\ncandidates = [(r['best'][t]['fid'], name, t) for name, r in runs.items() for t in r['tags']]\nFINAL_FID, FINAL_RUN, FINAL_TAG = min(candidates)\nfinal_info = runs[FINAL_RUN]['best'][FINAL_TAG]\nfinal_generator = Generator(dim_z=dim_z).to(device)\nfinal_generator.load_state_dict(final_info['state'])\nfinal_generator.eval()\nwith torch.no_grad():\n    _z = torch.randn(10000, dim_z, generator=torch.Generator().manual_seed(SEED + 7)).to(device)\n    test_fid_final = fid_from_feats(feats_and_probs(test_images)[0], feats_and_probs(final_generator(_z))[0])\nprint(f'最终模型：{FINAL_RUN} 的 {FINAL_TAG} 权重，第 {final_info[\"epoch\"]} 轮，'\n      f'FID（对训练集参考）{FINAL_FID:.3f}，FID（对测试集）{test_fid_final:.3f}；'\n      f'真实测试集对训练集参考的 FID 为 {REAL_TEST_STATS[\"fid\"]:.3f}')\npd.DataFrame(table).set_index('setting').round(4)","metadata":{"trusted":true},"outputs":[],"execution_count":null},{"id":"cell-28","cell_type":"markdown","source":"## 随机种子对照：beta1=0.9（A）和 0.5（B）的差距是否稳定\n\n只比较 200 轮、不衰减学习率的组。500 轮的组取其前 200 轮内的最低 FID，等同于一次 200 轮的训练。种子 42 的 B 组不在本次运行中时，用第一轮的结果补上（评估分类器用同一个种子训练，数值大致可比）。如果 A 的几次结果都明显好于 B，就说明 beta1 的影响不是随机波动。","metadata":{}},{"id":"cell-29","cell_type":"code","source":"def best_within(r, tag, max_epoch):\n    vals = [ev[f'{tag}_fid'] for ev in r['eval_log'] if ev['epoch'] <= max_epoch]\n    return min(vals) if vals else float('nan')\n\nseed_rows, seen = [], set()\nfor name, r in runs.items():\n    c = r['cfg']\n    if r['kind'] != 'gan' or c.get('lr_decay_start') or c['group'] not in ('A', 'B') or c['epochs'] < 200:\n        continue\n    key = (c['group'], c['seed'])\n    if key in seen:\n        continue\n    seen.add(key)\n    seed_rows.append({'group': c['group'], 'seed': c['seed'], 'source': name if c['epochs'] == 200 else f'{name} 前 200 轮',\n                      'best_fid_raw': best_within(r, 'raw', 200), 'best_fid_ema0.999': best_within(r, 'ema0.999', 200)})\nfor g, rec in ROUND1_SEED42.items():\n    if (g, SEED) not in seen and any(row['group'] == g for row in seed_rows):\n        seed_rows.append({'group': g, 'seed': SEED, 'source': '第一轮结果', **rec})\nif seed_rows:\n    seed_df = pd.DataFrame(seed_rows).sort_values(['group', 'seed'])\n    seed_df.to_csv(OUT_ROOT / 'gan_seed_check.csv', index=False, encoding='utf-8-sig')\n    seed_summary = seed_df.groupby('group')[['best_fid_raw', 'best_fid_ema0.999']].agg(['mean', 'std', 'count']).round(2)\n    display(seed_df.round(2))\n    display(seed_summary)\nelse:\n    seed_df, seed_summary = None, None\n    print('本次没有运行随机种子对照的组。')","metadata":{"trusted":true},"outputs":[],"execution_count":null},{"id":"cell-30","cell_type":"code","source":"# 各组 FID 随训练轮数的变化（实线：原始权重；虚线：该组最好的 EMA 权重）\nfig, axs = plt.subplots(1, 2, figsize=(15, 4.4))\nfor i, (name, r) in enumerate(runs.items()):\n    color = f'C{i % 10}'\n    ep = [ev['epoch'] for ev in r['eval_log']]\n    best_ema = min((t for t in r['tags'] if t != 'raw'), key=lambda t: r['best'][t]['fid'])\n    axs[0].plot(ep, [ev['raw_fid'] for ev in r['eval_log']], color=color, lw=1, label=f'{name} raw')\n    axs[0].plot(ep, [ev[f'{best_ema}_fid'] for ev in r['eval_log']], color=color, ls='--', label=f'{name} {best_ema}')\n    axs[1].plot(ep, [ev['raw_min_share'] for ev in r['eval_log']], color=color, label=name)\naxs[0].axhline(REAL_TEST_STATS['fid'], color='k', ls=':', label='real test set')\naxs[0].set(xlabel='Epoch', ylabel='FID (lower is better)', title='FID during training', yscale='log')\naxs[1].axhline(0.1, color='k', ls=':', lw=1)\naxs[1].set(xlabel='Epoch', ylabel='Smallest class share', title='Class coverage of generated digits (raw G)', ylim=(0, 0.12))\nfor ax in axs:\n    ax.grid(alpha=0.25); ax.legend(fontsize=6.5, ncol=2)\nfig.tight_layout()\nfig.savefig(OUT_ROOT / 'gan_fid_and_coverage_by_setting.png', bbox_inches='tight', facecolor='white', dpi=160)\nplt.show()\n\n# 500 轮两组的学习率与 FID 对照（只在两组都运行时画）\nif 'A_500' in runs and 'A_500_lrdecay' in runs:\n    fig, axs = plt.subplots(1, 2, figsize=(14, 4))\n    for name, color in (('A_500', 'C0'), ('A_500_lrdecay', 'C3')):\n        r = runs[name]\n        axs[0].plot([e['epoch'] for e in r['epoch_log']], [e['lr'] for e in r['epoch_log']], color=color, label=name)\n        ep = [ev['epoch'] for ev in r['eval_log']]\n        for t, ls in zip(r['tags'], ['-', '--', ':']):\n            axs[1].plot(ep, [ev[f'{t}_fid'] for ev in r['eval_log']], color=color, ls=ls, label=f'{name} {t}')\n    axs[0].set(xlabel='Epoch', ylabel='learning rate', title='Learning rate schedule')\n    axs[1].set(xlabel='Epoch', ylabel='FID', title='FID, epochs 100-500', yscale='log', xlim=(100, None))\n    for ax in axs:\n        ax.grid(alpha=0.25); ax.legend(fontsize=7)\n    fig.tight_layout()\n    fig.savefig(OUT_ROOT / 'gan_500_epochs_lr_decay.png', bbox_inches='tight', facecolor='white', dpi=160)\n    plt.show()","metadata":{"trusted":true},"outputs":[],"execution_count":null},{"id":"cell-31","cell_type":"markdown","source":"## 题目要求的结果：损失曲线与生成图像（使用模板的可视化代码）\n\n先给最终选中那一组的结果。另外两个 500 轮的组只要在本次运行中且不是最终组，也给出损失曲线和生成图，便于比较学习率衰减的效果。","metadata":{}},{"id":"cell-32","cell_type":"code","source":"def show_required_figures(run, prefix):\n    if run['kind'] != 'gan':\n        print(f'{run[\"name\"]} 是 WGAN-GP，损失含义不同，用后面的扩展损失图。')\n        return\n    lg = run['logs']\n    print(f'---- {run[\"name\"]}：模板 monitor_losses（100 步滑动平均）----')\n    with save_template_figure(OUT_ROOT / f'{prefix}_template_losses.png'):\n        monitor_losses(lg['d_loss'], lg['d_loss_fake'], lg['g_loss'], lg['g_loss_fake'])\n\ndef load_generator(state):\n    g = Generator(dim_z=dim_z).to(device)\n    g.load_state_dict(state)\n    return g.eval()\n\nprint('==== 最终模型 ====')\nshow_required_figures(runs[FINAL_RUN], 'final')\nprint(f'---- 最终模型（{FINAL_RUN}, {FINAL_TAG}, 第 {final_info[\"epoch\"]} 轮）：模板 monitor_images ----')\nwith torch.no_grad(), save_template_figure(OUT_ROOT / 'final_template_images.png'):\n    monitor_images(final_generator, test_noise, with_condition=False)\n\nCONTRAST_RUNS = [n for n in ('A_500', 'A_500_lrdecay', 'A_template') if n in runs and n != FINAL_RUN][:2]\nfor name in CONTRAST_RUNS:\n    print(f'==== 对照：{name}（训练结束时的原始权重）====')\n    show_required_figures(runs[name], name)\n    with torch.no_grad(), save_template_figure(OUT_ROOT / f'{name}_final_images.png'):\n        monitor_images(load_generator(runs[name]['final_states']['raw']), test_noise, with_condition=False)","metadata":{"trusted":true},"outputs":[],"execution_count":null},{"id":"cell-33","cell_type":"code","source":"# 扩展损失图：每轮平均的 D、G 损失（带 D=0.5 参考线）和 D(x)、D(G(z))，所有组画在一起\ngan_runs = {k: v for k, v in runs.items() if v['kind'] == 'gan'}\nfig, axs = plt.subplots(1, 3, figsize=(17, 4.2))\nfor i, (name, r) in enumerate(gan_runs.items()):\n    ep = [e['epoch'] for e in r['epoch_log']]\n    axs[0].plot(ep, [e['d_loss'] for e in r['epoch_log']], color=f'C{i}', label=name)\n    axs[1].plot(ep, [e['g_loss'] for e in r['epoch_log']], color=f'C{i}', label=name)\n    axs[2].plot(ep, [e['real_score'] for e in r['epoch_log']], color=f'C{i}', label=f'{name} D(x)')\n    axs[2].plot(ep, [e['fake_score'] for e in r['epoch_log']], color=f'C{i}', ls='--', label=f'{name} D(G(z))')\naxs[0].axhline(2 * math.log(2), color='k', ls=':', label='D = 0.5 (1.386)')\naxs[1].axhline(math.log(2), color='k', ls=':', label='D = 0.5 (0.693)')\naxs[2].axhline(0.5, color='k', ls=':')\naxs[0].set(title='Discriminator loss (epoch mean)', xlabel='Epoch')\naxs[1].set(title='Generator loss (epoch mean)', xlabel='Epoch')\naxs[2].set(title='Mean discriminator output', xlabel='Epoch', ylim=(0, 1))\nfor ax in axs:\n    ax.grid(alpha=0.25); ax.legend(fontsize=7)\nfig.tight_layout()\nfig.savefig(OUT_ROOT / 'gan_epoch_losses_all_settings.png', bbox_inches='tight', facecolor='white', dpi=160)\nplt.show()\n\nif 'E_wgan_gp' in runs:\n    r = runs['E_wgan_gp']; ep = [e['epoch'] for e in r['epoch_log']]\n    fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(7, 3.8))\n    ax.plot(ep, [e['w_estimate'] for e in r['epoch_log']], label='W estimate = E f(x) - E f(G(z))')\n    ax.plot(ep, [e['g_loss'] for e in r['epoch_log']], label='generator loss')\n    ax.set(xlabel='Epoch', title='WGAN-GP'); ax.grid(alpha=0.25); ax.legend(fontsize=8)\n    fig.tight_layout(); fig.savefig(OUT_ROOT / 'wgan_gp_curves.png', bbox_inches='tight', facecolor='white', dpi=160)\n    plt.show()","metadata":{"trusted":true},"outputs":[],"execution_count":null},{"id":"cell-34","cell_type":"code","source":"# 最终模型 10×10 生成图（与模板相同的 Greys 显示方式）\nwith torch.no_grad():\n    z = torch.randn(100, dim_z, generator=torch.Generator().manual_seed(SEED + 2026)).to(device)\n    samples = final_generator(z).cpu().numpy()\nfig, axs = plt.subplots(10, 10, figsize=(9, 9))\nfor k, ax in enumerate(axs.ravel()):\n    ax.imshow(samples[k].reshape(28, 28), cmap='Greys'); ax.axis('off')\nfig.suptitle(f'100 samples from the final generator ({FINAL_RUN}, {FINAL_TAG}, epoch {final_info[\"epoch\"]})')\nfig.tight_layout(); fig.savefig(OUT_ROOT / 'final_samples_10x10.png', bbox_inches='tight', facecolor='white', dpi=160)\nplt.show()\n\n# 固定噪声在不同轮次的生成结果：最终组与模板组 A\ndef plot_progress(run, path):\n    eps = sorted(run['snapshots'])\n    fig, axs = plt.subplots(len(eps), 16, figsize=(16, 1.05 * len(eps) + 0.5))\n    axs = np.atleast_2d(axs)\n    for i, e in enumerate(eps):\n        for j in range(16):\n            axs[i, j].imshow(run['snapshots'][e][j].reshape(28, 28), cmap='Greys')\n            axs[i, j].set_xticks([]); axs[i, j].set_yticks([])\n        axs[i, 0].set_ylabel(f'ep {e}', rotation=0, ha='right', va='center', fontsize=9)\n    fig.suptitle(f'{run[\"name\"]}: the same 16 noise vectors over training (raw G)')\n    fig.tight_layout(); fig.savefig(path, bbox_inches='tight', facecolor='white', dpi=150)\n    plt.show()\n\nplot_progress(runs[FINAL_RUN], OUT_ROOT / 'final_progress_fixed_noise.png')\nfor name in CONTRAST_RUNS:\n    plot_progress(runs[name], OUT_ROOT / f'{name}_progress_fixed_noise.png')","metadata":{"trusted":true},"outputs":[],"execution_count":null},{"id":"cell-35","cell_type":"code","source":"# 模式坍塌检查：10000 张生成图的类别分布\nfinal_stats = evaluate_generator(final_generator, n=10000, seed=SEED + 4242)\ndist_rows = {'Real test set': REAL_TEST_STATS['class_share'], f'Final ({FINAL_RUN}, {FINAL_TAG})': final_stats['class_share']}\nfor name in CONTRAST_RUNS:\n    dist_rows[f'{name} (last epoch, raw)'] = evaluate_generator(load_generator(runs[name]['final_states']['raw']),\n                                                                 n=10000, seed=SEED + 4242)['class_share']\nfig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(11, 3.8))\nw = 0.8 / len(dist_rows)\nfor i, (label, share) in enumerate(dist_rows.items()):\n    ax.bar(np.arange(10) + (i - (len(dist_rows) - 1) / 2) * w, share, w, label=label)\nax.axhline(0.1, color='k', ls=':', lw=1)\nax.set_xticks(range(10)); ax.set(xlabel='Digit predicted by the evaluation classifier', ylabel='Share',\n                                 title='Class distribution of 10,000 generated digits')\nax.legend(fontsize=8); ax.grid(axis='y', alpha=0.2)\nfig.tight_layout(); fig.savefig(OUT_ROOT / 'final_class_distribution.png', bbox_inches='tight', facecolor='white', dpi=160)\nplt.show()\nprint('最终模型 10000 张：FID', round(final_stats['fid'], 3), '| 分类器得分', round(final_stats['score'], 3),\n      '| 各类比例', np.round(final_stats['class_share'], 3).tolist())","metadata":{"trusted":true},"outputs":[],"execution_count":null},{"id":"cell-36","cell_type":"markdown","source":"## 训练现象的数值摘要（写报告时对照图片核实）","metadata":{}},{"id":"cell-37","cell_type":"code","source":"def describe_run(r):\n    lines = []\n    el, ev = r['epoch_log'], r['eval_log']\n    n = len(el); k = max(1, n // 10)\n    mean = lambda rows, key: float(np.mean([x[key] for x in rows]))\n    if r['kind'] == 'gan':\n        lines.append(f'前 {k} 轮平均 d_loss {mean(el[:k], \"d_loss\"):.3f}、g_loss {mean(el[:k], \"g_loss\"):.3f}、'\n                     f'D(x) {mean(el[:k], \"real_score\"):.3f}、D(G(z)) {mean(el[:k], \"fake_score\"):.3f}；'\n                     f'最后 {k} 轮 d_loss {mean(el[-k:], \"d_loss\"):.3f}、g_loss {mean(el[-k:], \"g_loss\"):.3f}、'\n                     f'D(x) {mean(el[-k:], \"real_score\"):.3f}、D(G(z)) {mean(el[-k:], \"fake_score\"):.3f}。')\n        lines.append(f'最后 {k} 轮内逐次迭代的标准差：d_loss {np.mean([x[\"d_loss_std\"] for x in el[-k:]]):.3f}，'\n                     f'g_loss {np.mean([x[\"g_loss_std\"] for x in el[-k:]]):.3f}。')\n    for t in r['tags']:\n        b = r['best'][t]\n        lines.append(f'{t}：FID 最低 {b[\"fid\"]:.2f}（第 {b[\"epoch\"]} 轮），末轮 {ev[-1][f\"{t}_fid\"]:.2f}。')\n    if ev[-1]['raw_fid'] > 1.15 * r['best']['raw']['fid']:\n        lines.append('原始权重末轮 FID 比最低值高出 15% 以上，后期质量有回落。')\n    late = [x['raw_fid'] for x in ev if x['epoch'] > 0.5 * r['cfg']['epochs']]\n    if len(late) > 2:\n        jumps = np.abs(np.diff(late))\n        lines.append(f'后半程原始权重相邻两次评估的 FID 平均相差 {jumps.mean():.2f}，最大相差 {jumps.max():.2f}。')\n    worst_late = min((x for x in ev if x['epoch'] >= 50), key=lambda x: x['raw_min_share'], default=None)\n    if worst_late:\n        lines.append(f'第 50 轮以后最小类别比例最低为 {worst_late[\"raw_min_share\"]:.3f}（第 {worst_late[\"epoch\"]} 轮），'\n                     f'末轮为 {ev[-1][\"raw_min_share\"]:.3f}。')\n    return lines\n\nnotes = {}\nfor name, r in runs.items():\n    notes[name] = describe_run(r)\n    print(f'【{name}】')\n    for line in notes[name]:\n        print('  -', line)","metadata":{"trusted":true},"outputs":[],"execution_count":null},{"id":"cell-38","cell_type":"code","source":"def df_to_md(df):\n    cols = list(df.columns)\n    out = ['| ' + ' | '.join(map(str, cols)) + ' |', '|' + '---|' * len(cols)]\n    out += ['| ' + ' | '.join(str(v) for v in row) + ' |' for row in df.itertuples(index=False)]\n    return '\\n'.join(out)\n\nlines = ['# 问题二 GAN 实验汇总（第二轮，自动生成）', '',\n         f'生成时间 {datetime.now().isoformat(timespec=\"seconds\")}；设备 {device}；种子 {SEED}', '',\n         '## 公共设置', '',\n         f'- 数据：MNIST 训练集 60000 张，像素换算到 [-1,1]（与模板 Normalize(0.5,0.5) 相同）。',\n         f'- 生成器：{dim_z}→128→256→512→784，LeakyReLU(0.2)，输出 Tanh；无 BN、无 dropout。',\n         '- 判别器：784→512→256→128→1，LeakyReLU(0.2) + Dropout(0.3)，输出 Sigmoid；无 BN。',\n         f'- 损失：BCELoss；判别器 -log D(x) - log(1-D(G(z)))，生成器 -log D(G(z))（非饱和）。',\n         f'- Adam，基础学习率 {lr}，batch {batch_size}，d_freq {d_freq}；每 {EVAL_EVERY} 轮评估 FID；EMA 系数 {EMA_DECAYS}。',\n         f'- 评估分类器测试准确率 {acc:.4f}；真实测试集 FID {REAL_TEST_STATS[\"fid\"]:.3f}。', '',\n         '## 各组设置', '']\nfor name in runs:\n    lines.append(f'- {name}: {runs[name][\"cfg\"]}')\nlines += ['', '## 对比', '', df_to_md(pd.DataFrame(table).round(4)), '',\n          f'## 最终模型', '',\n          f'{FINAL_RUN} 的 {FINAL_TAG} 权重，第 {final_info[\"epoch\"]} 轮；'\n          f'FID（训练集参考）{FINAL_FID:.3f}，FID（测试集）{test_fid_final:.3f}；'\n          f'10000 张生成图各类比例 {np.round(final_stats[\"class_share\"], 3).tolist()}。', '', '## 观察', '']\nif seed_summary is not None:\n    lines += ['## 随机种子对照', '', df_to_md(seed_df.round(2)), '',\n              df_to_md(seed_summary.reset_index().set_axis([' '.join(map(str, c)).strip() for c in seed_summary.reset_index().columns], axis=1)), '']\nfor name, ls in notes.items():\n    lines.append(f'### {name}')\n    lines += [f'- {x}' for x in ls]\n    lines.append('')\nlines += ['## 文件', ''] + [f'- `{p.name}`' for p in sorted(OUT_ROOT.glob('*')) if p.is_file()]\n(OUT_ROOT / 'gan_auto_summary.md').write_text('\\n'.join(lines), encoding='utf-8')\n\ntorch.save({'state_dict': final_info['state'], 'run': FINAL_RUN, 'weights': FINAL_TAG, 'epoch': final_info['epoch']},\n           OUT_ROOT / 'final_generator.pt')\nfor name, r in runs.items():\n    pd.DataFrame(r['epoch_log']).to_csv(OUT_ROOT / f'{name}_epoch_log.csv', index=False)\n    pd.DataFrame([{k: (json.dumps(v) if isinstance(v, list) else v) for k, v in ev.items()} for ev in r['eval_log']]\n                 ).to_csv(OUT_ROOT / f'{name}_eval_log.csv', index=False)\n    np.savez_compressed(OUT_ROOT / f'{name}_iteration_logs.npz', **r['logs'])\nzip_path = shutil.make_archive(str(OUT_ROOT.parent / 'hw2_gan_results'), 'zip', root_dir=OUT_ROOT.parent, base_dir=OUT_ROOT.name)\nprint('汇总:', OUT_ROOT / 'gan_auto_summary.md')\nprint(f'打包: {zip_path}（{Path(zip_path).stat().st_size / 2**20:.1f} MB）')","metadata":{"trusted":true},"outputs":[],"execution_count":null},{"id":"cell-39","cell_type":"markdown","source":"## 结果怎么读\n\n1. **A_500 与第一轮 A 对照**：看 FID 在 200 轮以后是否继续下降、在哪一轮最低。若 300 轮后基本不动，说明 500 轮已足够。\n2. **A_500_lrdecay 与 A_500 对照**：两组前 250 轮完全一样，差别只来自后半程学习率。看 `gan_500_epochs_lr_decay.png`：衰减组原始权重的 FID 是否更平稳、更低，EMA 带来的额外收益是否变小（参数摆动变小后，平均的作用也会变小）。\n3. **两种 EMA 系数**：0.9999 平均的窗口约 21 轮，0.999 约 2 轮。训练后期模型变化慢时长窗口可能更好；变化快时长窗口会把较早、较差的权重也平均进去。\n4. **随机种子对照**：A 与 B 的均值差距若远大于各自的标准差，beta1 的结论就可靠。\n5. **报告用的图**：最终模型的模板损失曲线、模板生成图、10×10 大图、固定噪声变化图、类别分布图，以及 FID 对比图。","metadata":{}}]}